Mode 1 is typically ON ($b_1 \gg 0$).                                           
Mode 0 is typically OFF ($b_1 \approx 0$).                                      
                                                                                
One more check: buck converter equations.                                       
$\dot{i}_L = 1/L \cdot (V_{switch} - v_C)$                                      
$\dot{v}_C = 1/C \cdot (i_L - v_C/R)$                                           
So $\dot{x}_2 = \frac{1}{C}x_1 - \frac{1}{RC}x_2$.                              
Coefficients $a_{21}$ and $a_{22}$ should be the same in both modes.            
                                                                                
