differences on the order of $10^{-15}$ to $10^{-7}$, which are within numerical 
integration/precision limits. Thus, **no state resets** are present; the state  
trajectories are continuous.                                                    
                                                                                
### 3. Additional context (if relevant):                                        
The "1st order" mention in the prompt likely referred to the local linearity or 
