b1={results[1]['b1']:.4f}. Mode 3 (DCM): a11={results[2]['a11']:.4f},           
a12={results[2]['a12']:.4f}, b1={results[2]['b1']:.4f}. Guard 1->2 occurs at    
peak x1, 2->3 when x1 ~ 0, and 3->1 likely on a timer/clock signal. No          
significant state resets were observed; state values remain continuous across   
boundaries.",                                                                   
    "Additional context": "The buck converter operates in Continuous Conduction 
Mode (CCM) across Modes 1 and 2, entering Discontinuous Conduction Mode (DCM) in
