    - $x_1[k+1] = 0.9996 x_1[k] - 0.0039 x_2[k] + 0.0475$                       
    - $x_2[k+1] = 0.0402 x_1[k] + 0.9982 x_2[k] + 0.0163$                       
*   **Mode 2 (Discharging):** $x_1$ decreases.                                  
